141 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Real-time Alerts: Critical GRB alerts and their initial characteristics are relayed almost instantaneously \(at 2 kbps\) via the NASA TDRSS \(Tracking and Data Relay Satellite System\) space data link to the GRB Coordinate Network \(GCN\). This rapid distribution, often triggering alerts for astronomers worldwide , is vital. This immediate dissemination allows other ground-based and space-based observatories to quickly re-point their instruments and initiate follow-up observations of the same transient event, forming a coordinated multi-observatory campaign.)
/E (Real-time Alerts: Critical GRB alerts and their initial characteristics are relayed almost instantaneously \(at 2 kbps\) via the NASA TDRSS \(Tracking and Data Relay Satellite System\) space data link to the GRB Coordinate Network \(GCN\). This rapid distribution, often triggering alerts for astronomers worldwide , is vital. This immediate dissemination allows other ground-based and space-based observatories to quickly re-point their instruments and initiate follow-up observations of the same transient event, forming a coordinated multi-observatory campaign.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
