/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Swift's core operational mode for GRBs is characterized by a high degree of autonomy. The Burst Alert Telescope \(BAT\) detects a gamma-ray burst, calculates a coarse position, and then autonomously triggers the spacecraft to slew. This re-points the narrow-field XRT and UVOT instruments to the burst location within seconds. )
/E (Swift's core operational mode for GRBs is characterized by a high degree of autonomy. The Burst Alert Telescope \(BAT\) detects a gamma-ray burst, calculates a coarse position, and then autonomously triggers the spacecraft to slew. This re-points the narrow-field XRT and UVOT instruments to the burst location within seconds. )
