152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In burst mode, a trigger algorithm continuously monitors for excesses in the detector count rate above background, applying a variety of criteria to identify genuine bursts. Upon detection, the BAT swiftly calculates an initial position \(with an accuracy of 1-4 arcminutes\) within seconds and, if warranted, sends a command for the spacecraft to slew to the burst location. This decision is made by a "figure-of-merit \(FOM\)" algorithm embedded in the flight software, which prioritizes new, interesting transients.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
